    slug: "vibrant-mediterranean-escape-top-summer-travel-list-choice",
    title: "地中海度假时光：夏日旅行清单的终极选择？",
    titleEn: "Vibrant Mediterranean Escape - Top Summer Travel List Choice",
    tagline: "When the dedication meets the destination: Does this vibrant Mediterranean escape top your summer travel list, or are yo",
    taglineEn: "Vibrant Mediterranean travel destination with summer vibes.",
    category: "other",
    engines: ["nano-banana-pro"],
