    titleEn: "Style Mixed Breakfast Cafe",
    tagline: "Mixture of Styles",
    taglineEn: "AI image prompt.",
    category: "other",
    engines: ["nano-banana-pro"],
    difficulty: 3,
    prompt: "Mixture of Styles\nWith Nano Banana Pro you can blend wildly different styles into one coherent image — anime next to a pencil sketch next to a full claymation character, all sharing the same world. Want to try it yourself?\nOpen Nano Banana Pro on your favorite surface and run the prompt below.\nThe setting is an ultra-realistic, editorial-quality photograph capturing a busy breakfast café at mid-morning—sunlight spilling through tall windows, steam rising from espresso cups, soft clatter of plates, and an overall warm, bustling atmosphere. In the immediate foreground sits an anime-styled man with vivid blue hair, rendered with perfectly integrated cel-shading, crisp line art, and subtle specular lighting, yet placed with photographic depth-of-field so he feels physically present within the space. At the next table in the mid-ground, one of the patrons appears as a pencil-sketch figure, drawn in delicate graphite with visible cross-hatching and textured paper grain, seamlessly embedded into the real environment as if occupying a parallel medium. In the distant background, another customer is portrayed in full claymation style, shaped from hand-molded colored clay with visible fingerprints, matte surfaces, and slight frame-by-frame imperfections that suggest stop-motion movement. The entire scene blends these three visual languages into one cohesive cinematic image with rich ambient lighting, shallow depth-of-field transitions, and hyper-detailed café textures. No text overlays.",
