    category: "other",
    engines: ["nano-banana-pro"],
    difficulty: 3,
    prompt: "Use your own picture to create this image . It was done on @Somake_ai using Nano Banana Pro\nPrompt :\nA cinematic fine-art gallery interior with warm, moody lighting. A woman with curly dark hair, wearing a long black dress and ankle boots, stands thoughtfully between two large portrait artworks. On the left, a hyper-realistic photographic portrait with deep burgundy background, soft studio lighting, sharp facial detail, and elegant color grading. On the right, an expressive oil painting of the same woman, created with bold brush strokes, vibrant reds, blues, and oranges, emphasizing emotion and texture. Google Gemini Minimalist gallery walls with worn plaster textures, polished concrete floor, museum-style composition, shallow depth of field, cinematic framing, high realism, artistic contrast between realism and abstraction, gallery exhibition atmosphere, 8K detail, professional fine-art photography style.",
    rawBlock: "Use your own picture to create this image . It was done on @Somake_ai using Nano Banana Pro\nPrompt :\nA cinematic fine-art gallery interior with warm, moody lighting. A woman with curly dark hair, wearing a long black dress and ankle boots, stands thoughtfully between two large portrait artworks. On the left, a hyper-realistic photographic portrait with deep burgundy background, soft studio lighting, sharp facial detail, and elegant color grading. On the right, an expressive oil painting of the same woman, created with bold brush strokes, vibrant reds, blues, and oranges, emphasizing emotion and texture. Google Gemini Minimalist gallery walls with worn plaster textures, polished concrete floor, museum-style composition, shallow depth of field, cinematic framing, high realism, artistic contrast between realism and abstraction, gallery exhibition atmosphere, 8K detail, professional fine-art photography style.",
