    category: "other",
    engines: ["other"],
    difficulty: 3,
    prompt: "#空想AIファッション\nIdea from @KusoPhoto\n---prompt---\nA dreamy, low-saturation film photo of a stunning Korean K-pop idol with a \"pure and sexy\" (innocent face, alluring vibe) aesthetic. She has an extremely fresh, clean makeup look: clear porcelain skin, soft peach blush, natural eyelashes, and soft pink gradient lips. NO smoky eyes, NO heavy eyeliner. Her hair is long, soft, fluffy, and dry (natural texture), blowing gently. She is wearing the multicolored floral print long-sleeve crop top with high neckline (red, blue, yellow, green pattern on black base), paired with the voluminous black full circle maxi skirt. The lighting is extremely soft, overexposed Japanese airy style, creating a milky, low-contrast atmosphere. Muted colors, desaturated tones, soft focus, film grain.  --no smoky eyes, heavy makeup, wet hair, oily skin, dark shadows, high contrast, neon colors",
