    slug: "nano-banana-pro-detective-evidence-board-in-firefly",
    title: "侦探证据板：火萤中的Nano Banana侦探",
    titleEn: "Nano Banana Pro Detective Evidence Board In Firefly",
    tagline: "Prompt Studio: Nano Banana Pro Detective Evidence Board, in Firefly",
    taglineEn: "AI image prompt.",
    category: "other",
    engines: ["nano-banana-pro"],
    difficulty: 3,
    prompt: "Prompt Studio: Nano Banana Pro Detective Evidence Board, in Firefly\nA detective's evidence board investigating [SUBJECT/MYSTERY]. Cork surface covered with pinned items: polaroid photographs with handwritten dates, a street map with circled locations, newspaper clippings with highlighted passages, sticky notes with theories and question marks, and printed documents with redacted black bars. Red string connects related evidence across the board, creating a web of connections. Thumbtacks in primary colors. A single bare bulb casts dramatic shadows. Coffee ring stains on some papers. The atmosphere is obsessive, late-night, noir—someone has been piecing this together for months. A few pins have fallen, suggesting frantic recent activity.\nCheck ALTs for ideas 👇",
    rawBlock: "Prompt Studio: Nano Banana Pro Detective Evidence Board, in Firefly\nA detective's evidence board investigating [SUBJECT/MYSTERY]. Cork surface covered with pinned items: polaroid photographs with handwritten dates, a street map with circled locations, newspaper clippings with highlighted passages, sticky notes with theories and question marks, and printed documents with redacted black bars. Red string connects related evidence across the board, creating a web of connections. Thumbtacks in primary colors. A single bare bulb casts dramatic shadows. Coffee ring stains on some papers. The atmosphere is obsessive, late-night, noir—someone has been piecing this together for months. A few pins have fallen, suggesting frantic recent activity.\nCheck ALTs for ideas 👇",
    images: [{"src":"https://media.aiartspell.art/images/prompts/20251228/nano-banana-pro-detective-evidence-board-in-firefly-1.jpg","alt":"侦探证据板：火萤中的纳米香蕉侦探","width":500,"isThumb":false},{"src":"https://media.aiartspell.art/images/prompts/20251228/nano-banana-pro-detective-evidence-board-in-firefly-2.jpg","alt":"侦探证据板：火萤中的纳米香蕉侦探","width":500,"isThumb":false},{"src":"https://media.aiartspell.art/images/prompts/20251228/nano-banana-pro-detective-evidence-board-in-firefly-3.jpg","alt":"侦探证据板：火萤中的纳米香蕉侦探","width":500,"isThumb":false},{"src":"https://media.aiartspell.art/images/prompts/20251228/nano-banana-pro-detective-evidence-board-in-firefly-4.jpg","alt":"侦探证据板：火萤中的纳米香蕉侦探","width":500,"isThumb":false}],
