    taglineEn: "AI image prompt.",
    category: "other",
    engines: ["other"],
    difficulty: 3,
    prompt: "Grok imagine\nBase Prompt @KusoPhoto\nA high-quality vertical portrait photo with a 3:4 aspect ratio, depicting a bright, outdoor scene at a beachside cafe or patio during daytime under sunny, clear, warm, and breezy weather. The scene features a young woman seated in the foreground at the center, leaning slightly forward with a friendly expression, her face softly lit by natural overhead/diffused sunlight with a neutral/warm color temperature. She has ash-grey hair styled with bangs and soft waves, wearing a red off-the-shoulder crop top with ruched detailing and ruffled edges, a black choker necklace paired with a thin gold chain, small gold hoop earrings, blue jeans with white drawstrings visible on the waistband and a black undergarment/waistband peeking out above, and soft, natural makeup with a pinkish lip tint. Her pose shows her seated, arms straight down between knees. The background is blurred, filled with white outdoor furniture and large, colorful beach umbrellas (one red and yellow with white piping along the edges and a metal pole, another blue, red, and yellow, partially cropped out of frame), under a clear blue sky, creating a summery, cheerful atmosphere. The color palette includes dominant hex colors #C83C3C, #A8A5A3, #8FA8C4, #F4F4F0, and #E8B444, with accent colors vivid red, denim blue, mustard yellow, and ash grey, and medium contrast. The composition uses an eye-level camera angle, medium-shot framing, shallow depth of field focusing on the woman’s face, with a white chair and table edge (white/beige, smooth, out of focus) in the mid-ground and foreground respectively. Additional blurred background figures, including a male figure in profile wearing a white shirt and dark hair, seated at a distance, indicate a public social space.",
